Malis has got a dog called Lucky. Lucky wears a red collar and sleeps in a kennel. Malis walks him on a leash and grooms his fur. Her cat uses a litter tray. Her brother's goldfish live in a fish tank, and his bird lives in a cage. Everybody gets pet food every day.

